messages.content:
Generate a standalone C reproducer that triggers this vulnerability:

File: apps/lib/apps.c
Line: 663
Function: warn_cert_msg
Bug type: null-pointer-dereference
CWE: CWE-476
Explanation: X509_NAME_oneline() can return NULL on error or allocation failure. The returned pointer 'subj' is passed to BIO_printf() with "%s" at line 663 without a NULL check, which will dereference a NULL pointer and crash.

